SUMMARY:Anchor Up Card Show: VFW Post 706
DESCRIPTION:Anchor Up runs a card show at the VFW post on the second Satur
 day of the month\, twelve of them across 2026\, and it is free to walk in
 . Fifty-odd tables of Pokémon\, One Piece\, sports cards and sealed prod
 uct\, slabs and singles\, vintage and modern. A VFW post is a veterans' o
 rganisation's own building and joining one is for veterans\, but the hall
  is where a neighbourhood's public events happen and this show is one of 
 them: it is advertised on open calendars with free admission\, and nobody
  is asked to prove anything at the door. It is the smaller\, more regular
  room next to the big UWF show\, and the same dealers work both.\nPrice: 
 Free\nArea: Pensacola\nTimes: Second Saturday · 9:00 AM-3:00 PM\nChecked
  against the venue's own page on 2026-09-05\nhttps://coastaleventures.com
 /events/ev-anchor-up-card-show-vfw706-1010.html
